  <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
  <p>BubbleNest is a social networking platform that helps users find friends, connect with friends and discover compatible matches based on shared interests, preferences, and location. We provide tools for users to create profiles, create posts, discover events, find potential matches, and communicate with other users. Our events feature allows you to discover local events, connect with other attendees, and manage your event attendance.</p>

